---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import CopyBlock from '../components/CopyBlock.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
import '../styles/information.css';
const description = 'You’re Flocked is an iPhone app that shows nearby surveillance cameras, warns you as you approach, and plans routes that pass fewer of them. Camera locations come from community-contributed map data. Route planning runs on the phone.';
const screenshots = [
  { image: 'camera-map', file: 'flckd-camera-map.png', title: 'The camera map', alt: 'You’re Flocked map with community-contributed camera locations.' },
  { image: 'routing', file: 'flckd-routing.png', title: 'Camera-aware routing', alt: 'The You’re Flocked route planner with avoidance controls.' },
  { image: 'alerts', file: 'flckd-alerts.png', title: 'Make alerts your own', alt: 'You’re Flocked settings for camera types and alert preferences.' },
] as const;
---
<SiteLayout title="Press kit · You’re Flocked" description="Writing about You’re Flocked? Download the app icon, original screenshots, and a fact sheet. Find a short description, product details, and project links.">
  <div class="wrap">
    <header class="page-heading"><h1>The short version.<br /><em>And the good pictures.</em></h1><p>Writing about You’re Flocked? Here’s a little background, a few useful facts, and the original assets. No sign-up or email exchange needed.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href="/press/flckd-press-kit.zip" download><Icon name="download" />Download press kit</a><a class="text-link" href={site.discussions} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask a question <Icon name="external" /></a></div><p class="download-note">ZIP · App icon, three screenshots, and a plain-text fact sheet</p></header>
    <section class="press-summary" aria-labelledby="short-version"><div><h2 id="short-version">Start with the short version.</h2><CopyBlock text={description} label="Short description" /></div><dl class="fact-list"><div><dt>Name</dt><dd>You’re Flocked</dd></div><div><dt>Platform</dt><dd>iPhone · iOS 17+ · public beta via <a href={site.testflight} target="_blank" rel="noopener">TestFlight</a></dd></div><div><dt>Project</dt><dd>Independent, open source</dd></div><div><dt>Camera data</dt><dd>DeFlock & OpenStreetMap</dd></div><div><dt>Source code</dt><dd><a href={site.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener">github.com/flckdapp/flckd <Icon name="external" /></a></dd></div></dl></section>
    <section class="press-assets" aria-labelledby="assets-heading"><div class="section-title"><h2 id="assets-heading">A closer look.</h2><p>Original PNGs. Full resolution. Ready for your story.</p></div><div class="screenshot-grid">{screenshots.map(item => <figure><a class="screenshot-preview" href={`/press/${item.file}`} download aria-label={`Download ${item.title} screenshot`}><img src={`/images/${item.image}.webp`} srcset={`/images/${item.image}-400.webp 400w, /images/${item.image}.webp 660w`} sizes="(max-width: 640px) 220px, (max-width: 900px) 200px, 280px" alt={item.alt} width="660" height="1434" loading="lazy" /></a><figcaption><div><strong>{item.title}</strong><span>PNG · 1320 × 2868</span></div><a href={`/press/${item.file}`} download aria-label={`Download ${item.title} PNG`}><Icon name="download" /></a></figcaption></figure>)}</div><div class="icon-download"><img src="/images/app-icon.webp" alt="You’re Flocked app icon: a pale bird with a blue camera-like eye on a dark background." width="96" height="96" /><div><h3>The app icon</h3><p>The original, without a device frame.</p><span class="fine-print">PNG · 1024 × 1024</span></div><a class="button secondary" href="/press/flckd-app-icon.png" download><Icon name="download" />Download icon</a></div><p class="fine-print">Screenshots show an example app state, not live camera coverage. Please keep visible map attribution intact. Third-party imagery and trademarks belong to their respective owners.</p></section>
    <section class="press-context prose"><div><h2>A few details<br />worth getting right.</h2><p>You’re Flocked makes surveillance cameras easier to see. It doesn’t claim to make someone invisible to them.</p></div><div><h3>The map is a community effort.</h3><p>Locations are contributed by people. Coverage can be incomplete or out of date, and camera-aware routing can’t guarantee a camera-free trip.</p><h3>On-device doesn’t mean entirely offline.</h3><p>Route planning and proximity calculations happen on the phone. Fresh camera lookups and Apple map imagery use network services. The <a href="/privacy/">privacy page</a> explains the distinction in plain terms, and links to the <a href={site.privacy} target="_blank" rel="noopener">full document</a>.</p><h3>It’s an independent project.</h3><p>You’re Flocked is inspired by <a href="https://deflock.me" target="_blank" rel="noopener">DeFlock</a>. It is not affiliated with or endorsed by Flock Safety. The current app is an iPhone beta distributed through TestFlight; Android is planned.</p></div></section>
    <section class="press-contact"><h2>Something else you need?</h2><p>For questions, corrections, or a detail that isn’t covered here, ask in the project’s Q&amp;A on GitHub Discussions. It’s public, so please keep private information out of it. Bugs go in Issues.</p><div class="actions"><a class="button" href={site.discussions} target="_blank" rel="noopener">Ask in GitHub Discussions <Icon name="external" /></a><a class="text-link" href="/press/flckd-fact-sheet.txt" download>Download the fact sheet <Icon name="download" /></a></div></section>
  </div>
</SiteLayout>
